      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think its a mental health thing tbh. it doesn't feel like an \"issue\" or anything bad. it feels like... clarity? like my body is finally tuning into frequencies that were always there but i was just too dull to notice. it feels more like an upgrade than a symptom. do you get what i mean? like my biology is just shifting into a higher gear?",
